{"3561490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cell Knights: TD", "steam_appid": 3561490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><i>Cell Knights: TD</i></strong>, where a mazing tower defense game themed in a Cells</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in progress but here's some of the content of this game:<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player campaign</strong> – Defend fountains and uncover the truth behind the outbreak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Path-mazing tower defense</strong> – Build your own maze with 2x2 tower grid defenses that shape enemy movement to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/extras/fce7e904f17b2acb49feb2e88782ad6d.poster.avif?t=1769393190\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/extras/fce7e904f17b2acb49feb2e88782ad6d.webm?t=1769393190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/extras/fce7e904f17b2acb49feb2e88782ad6d.mp4?t=1769393190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Towers </strong> – A 2x2 Cell Knight that pop, freeze, spin, smash, clean, reveal, and <i>accidentally</i> speed up enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge Towers -</strong> Merge same towers to upgrade and choose a random rune of stats acquire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Items</strong> – Carefully choose and place your loot items to cell knights to outsmart the infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/extras/bf3966bacca9829bd146dc887ba221bf.poster.avif?t=1769393190\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/extras/bf3966bacca9829bd146dc887ba221bf.webm?t=1769393190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/extras/bf3966bacca9829bd146dc887ba221bf.mp4?t=1769393190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Spells / Abilities</strong> -<strong> </strong>Get a random loot of AOE Spells, like Blizzard, Hellfire, Cannon Barrage, Regen Pulse and Overdrive to turn the tide of waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/extras/1ebc19d7c1a0920b583e4f701f5ec370.poster.avif?t=1769393190\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/extras/1ebc19d7c1a0920b583e4f701f5ec370.webm?t=1769393190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/extras/1ebc19d7c1a0920b583e4f701f5ec370.mp4?t=1769393190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Enemies - </strong>Lots of enemies, mini boss and boss each have their own specific skills/effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor -</strong> After completing the main campaign a level editor will be unlocked</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Plan Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More knights </strong>– Max level merge will breed a new tower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Items</strong> - Carefully choose and place your loot items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Spell Abilities</strong> - Get a random loot of AOE Spells.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode</strong> – Team up with friends to protect the kingdom together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer battles</strong> – Challenge others in strategic head-to-head tower defense duels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless mode</strong> – Survive as long as possible against waves of infected!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cell Knights: TD</i> is the most infectious tower defense game yet!<br><br>⚔️ <strong>Demo coming soon!</strong> <br><br><strong>P.S. Hi</strong> I'm a solo developer, and you can follow my progress on YouTube at <strong>Nutsaid</strong>! Hit that subscribe button to stay updated on <i>Cell Knights: TD</i> and more! 🚀</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><i>Cell Knights: TD</i></strong>, where a mazing tower defense game themed in a Cells</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in progress but here's some of the content of this game:<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player campaign</strong> – Defend fountains and uncover the truth behind the outbreak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Path-mazing tower defense</strong> – Build your own maze with 2x2 tower grid defenses that shape enemy movement to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/extras/fce7e904f17b2acb49feb2e88782ad6d.poster.avif?t=1769393190\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps